WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:04,480
Boss Xia, I also want to buy something. Whatever the customer wants to buy, he just asked for it.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,680
Give me a good one too

3
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:17,710
The total is 152 points. Please swipe your card and don’t look at it.

4
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:22,890
Everyone must be quiet

5
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:24,290
The hotel is far away

6
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:25,730
We try our best to protect everyone

7
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,010
Don't run around, auntie

8
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:35,820
We will definitely get it to everyone at the hotel safely.

9
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:41,850
I also have a protective son on the road

10
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,890
It doesn't matter what he asked you to come over for.

11
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:47,820
They just asked me to go with them to the second level. I refused and my son disagreed.

12
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,100
It means it’s not that simple

13
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,620
Now that I’ve said it, I’ll believe my son in the future.

14
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,820
I know you can't do anything like this.
